      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a 'find/locate' task — the potted_lily_of_the_valley is placed on a stone brick pedestal at spawn-relative (9, 1, 6) and the player must navigate to it and face it. max_distance=5 ensures the player has moved past the crafting table area (~7 blocks from spawn) to reach the pedestal (~10.8 blocks from spawn). facing_tolerance=60 confirms the player is looking at the potted plant.",
      "rules": [
